# CELL: pattern shape = BARE UNQUALIFIED VARIANT NAME (`case Red:`), which the
# parser builds as a `PBinding`, not a `PConstructor`.
#
# ⚠ THIS IS THE CELL THAT CAUGHT THE PORT'S OWN BUG. Whether a bare name is a
# catch-all or names a variant CANNOT be decided without the enum's variant
# list, so classifying `PBinding` in the pre-resolution catch-all scan makes the
# scan short-circuit here and SILENTLY ACCEPT this program. `PBinding` is
# therefore decided later, inside `collect_covered_variants`, which has
# `all_variants` in hand — mirroring Rust's structure exactly. The first seven
# probes of the design all passed; only widening to this axis exposed it.
enum Color:
    Red()
    Green()
    Blue()

void show(Color c):
    match c:
        case Red:
            print("red")
        case Green:
            print("green")

void main():
    show(Color.Blue())
